(iii) K(f) = Matrix([[-1/(f**2 - 1), f/(f**2 - 1)], [f/(f**2 - 1), -1/(f**2 - 1)]]); eigenvalues [-1/(f - 1), 1/(f + 1)]: ghost-free iff |f| < 1; lap(Phi, Phi_chi) = [4*pi*G*(f*rho_chi + rho_b), 4*pi*G*(f*rho_b + rho_chi)] (standard self-gravity, symmetric cross weight f); dL/df = (f**2*gPhi*gPhi_chi - f*gPhi**2 - f*gPhi_chi**2 + gPhi*gPhi_chi)/(4*pi*G*(f**4 - 2*f**2 + 1))
(iii)(a) conservation: d_j T^ij = -(dL/df) d_i f, so Xi must be a local field carrying it. The unswitched class (constant f; AX1's bimetric grading) has no such term; the switch adds a new scalar degree of freedom with that coupling.
